msgid ""
"Without the password, the only way back in is to unlink. This removes the "
"device from WhatsApp, deletes the chats stored here, and turns the app lock "
"off. You can link again with a new code."
msgstr ""
"沒有密碼，唯一能再次使用的方式就是取消連結。這會將此裝置從 WhatsApp 移除、刪"
"除儲存在此處的對話，並關閉應用程式鎖。之後可以用新代碼重新連結。"

